	"mode": "renewal",
	"note": "exp is exp_guild.yml with its imports for the mode, as GuildExpDatabase loads it: next_exp of a level is the guild exp needed to go from that level to the next. Levels run from 1 to MAX_GUILDLEVEL - 1, and a later file replaces a level. skills is guild_skill_tree.yml with its imports for the mode, as GuildSkillTreeDatabase loads it, by skill ID. Skills outside GD_SKILLBASE to GD_SKILLBASE + MAX_GUILDSKILL - 1 are skipped, and a required level of 0 is skipped. required is sorted by skill ID. With require_glory_guild on, GD_GLORYGUILD's MaxLevel 0 becomes 1. It is off by default, so its max_level stays as written. constants are the values rAthena compiles in the mode at PACKETVER 20211103, from src/common/mmo.hpp and src/config/const.hpp. GUILD_PERM_* are the position mode bits. storage: with OFFICIAL_GUILD_STORAGE (PACKETVER 20131223 or later), the guild storage holds 100 + 100 * the GD_GUILD_STORAGE level, and a guild without the skill cannot open it (storage_guild_storageopen and inter_guild_storagemax). skill is GD_GUILD_STORAGE's ID in skill_db.yml, or null when the mode's skill_db.yml does not have it. skill_in_range is false when the skill is missing or outside the mode's guild skill range. guild_checkskill then returns 0 for GD_GUILD_STORAGE (10016 in the source), so with OFFICIAL_GUILD_STORAGE no guild can open its storage, and size_by_level is empty. battle_config lists the guild settings after conf/battle_athena.conf and its imports, as battle_config_read, with battle.cpp's default, min and max for the mode. A value outside min and max falls back to the default. guild_max_member is 16 + 6 * the GD_EXTENSION level, capped at MAX_GUILD (guild_calcinfo in the char server).",
	"exp_files": [
		"db/exp_guild.yml",
		"db/re/exp_guild.yml"
	],
